---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Mixcoac Station Icon — 3D Animation">
  <article class="project-page">

    <header class="project-hero">
      <div class="hero-top">
        <a class="back-link" href="/animation">← Back to Animation</a>
        <p class="year">2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">3D ANIMATION · MOTION STUDY</p>

        <h1>
          Mixcoac<br />
          Station Icon<span>.</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="hero-bottom">
          <p class="intro">
            A short 3D animation study focused on timing, movement and visual
            rhythm using an existing rigged character model.
          </p>

          <p class="software">Blender</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="credits-note">
      <p class="section-label">PROJECT SCOPE</p>

      <div class="credits-content">
        <h2>Animation only</h2>

        <p>
          My contribution to this project was focused exclusively on animation.
          The character model and rig were downloaded as an existing asset and
          were not created by me.
        </p>

        <p>
          The work shown here focuses on posing, timing, spacing, movement,
          camera composition and the final animation sequence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="details-grid">
      <article>
        <p class="section-label">ROLE</p>
        <p>
          3D Animation<br />
          Posing<br />
          Timing and Spacing<br />
          Camera Animation
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <p class="section-label">ASSET</p>
        <p>
          Existing Downloaded Model<br />
          Existing Character Rig
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <p class="section-label">SOFTWARE</p>
        <p>Blender</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="media-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">FINAL ANIMATION</p>
        <h2>Mixcoac motion study</h2>

        <p class="section-intro">
          The animation was developed to explore readable poses, controlled
          timing and clear movement while preserving the recognizable identity
          of the Mixcoac Metro symbol.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="featured-video">
        <video
          src="/work/animation/Mixcoac_icono/mixcoac_icono.mp4"
          autoplay
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          controls
          preload="metadata"
        >
          Your browser does not support the video tag.
        </video>

        <p class="caption">
          Final animation created using an existing rigged model.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="overview-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">ANIMATION APPROACH</p>
        <h2>Movement through clear posing</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="overview-copy">
        <p>
          The process began by identifying the key poses needed to communicate
          the action clearly. These poses established the main rhythm and
          direction of the animation before the in-between movement was refined.
        </p>

        <p>
          Special attention was given to silhouette, balance and spacing so the
          motion remained readable throughout the sequence.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="media-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="section-label">PROCESS</p>
        <h2>Animation development</h2>

        <p class="section-intro">
          These clips show the progression from the first animation pass to the
          final polished movement.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="video-grid-2">
        <article class="video-item">
          <video
            src="/work/animation/Mixcoac_icono/snake_viweport.mp4"
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline
            controls
            preload="metadata"
          >
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
          </video>

          <div class="video-info">
            <p class="video-number">01</p>

            <div>
              <h3>Blocking</h3>
              <p>
                Initial key poses used to define the main action, timing and
                overall rhythm of the shot.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="video-item">
          <video
            src="/work/animation/Mixcoac_icono/totem_final.mp4"
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline
            controls
            preload="metadata"
          >
            Your browser does not support the video tag.
          </video>

          <div class="video-info">
            <p class="video-number">02</p>

            <div>
              <h3>Polish Pass</h3>
              <p>
                Refined timing, smoother transitions and final adjustments to
                spacing and body mechanics.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="breakdown-section">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">FOCUS AREAS</p>
        <h2>What I worked on</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-list">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Posing</h3>
            <p>
              Building clear silhouettes and readable character attitudes for
              each key moment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Timing and spacing</h3>
            <p>
              Adjusting the speed and distance between poses to create stronger
              rhythm and more intentional movement.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Camera composition</h3>
            <p>
              Framing the animation to keep the action clear and visually
              balanced throughout the sequence.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Final polish</h3>
            <p>
              Refining curves, transitions and subtle motion to improve the
              overall flow of the animation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="outcome-section">
      <p class="section-label">OUTCOME</p>

      <p class="outcome-text">
        This project helped me strengthen my understanding of posing, timing,
        spacing and animation polish while working with an existing
        production-ready rig.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="next-project">
      <p class="section-label">NEXT ANIMATION PROJECT</p>

      <a href="/projects/metro-symbol-02">
        <span>Metro Symbol Animation II</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-page {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 52px 0 120px;
  }

  .project-hero {
    min-height: 76vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 68px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .hero-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--muted, #888);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 180ms ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--fg, #f3f3f3);
  }

  .year,
  .eyebrow,
  .section-label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted, #888);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }

  .hero-content {
    margin-top: 72px;
  }

  .project-hero h1 {
    margin: 34px 0 68px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    font-size: clamp(62px, 10vw, 150px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 0.88;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .project-hero h1 span {
    color: var(--muted, #777);
  }

  .hero-bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 720px) auto;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    gap: 48px;
  }

  .intro {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .software {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted, #888);
    font-size: 13px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .credits-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 0.4fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
    gap: 70px;
    padding: 90px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .credits-content {
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .credits-content h2 {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .credits-content p {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .details-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
    padding: 58px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .details-grid article p:last-child {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--fg, #f3f3f3);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .media-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 46px;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .overview-section h2,
  .breakdown-section h2 {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .section-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .featured-video video,
  .video-item video {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .featured-video video {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .caption {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted, #888);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .overview-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: 80px;
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .overview-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .overview-copy p {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .video-grid-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .video-item video {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .video-info {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .video-number {
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted, #777);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .video-info h3,
  .focus-list h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .video-info p,
  .focus-list p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .breakdown-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(260px, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    gap: 80px;
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .focus-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .focus-list article {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 22px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .focus-list article:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .focus-list article > span {
    color: var(--muted, #777);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .outcome-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 0.4fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr);
    gap: 60px;
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .outcome-text {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--fg, #f3f3f3);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 46px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .next-project {
    padding-top: 90px;
  }

  .next-project a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding: 34px 0;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #292929);
  }

  .next-project a span:first-child {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .next-project a span:last-child {
    font-size: 38px;
    transition: transform 200ms ease;
  }

  .next-project a:hover span:last-child {
    transform: translateX(8px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .project-hero {
      min-height: 62vh;
    }

    .hero-bottom,
    .credits-note,
    .overview-section,
    .breakdown-section,
    .outcome-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .details-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .project-page {
      padding-top: 30px;
    }

    .project-hero h1 {
      font-size: 54px;
    }

    .details-grid,
    .video-grid-2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .credits-note,
    .overview-section,
    .media-section,
    .breakdown-section,
    .outcome-section {
      padding: 74px 0;
    }

    .software {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }
</style>